{
  "name": "Ooze Eidolon",
  "type": "ancestry",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a simple creature of protoplasm held together by magic and your mind. They often appear as creeping blobs of a single color, but this doesn't mean they can't have distinctive features, such as moss or fungus growing on their surface or bones and other debris floating within. Because they have been formed by your thoughts, your ooze eidolon isn't mindless, but likely doesn't have a complete personality. Though your ooze eidolon speaks no language, you might believe you can interpret the constant burbles and plops they make as a form of speaking.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> arcane</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> eidolon, ooze</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> the Universe</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> pseudopod (bludgeoning) Eidolon Attributes Con +3, Int –1, Wis +1, Cha +0</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Arcana, Athletics</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> motion sense (precise) 60 feet, no vision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> none</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 20 feet</p><p><strong>Eidolon Abilities</strong> Initial Ooze Physiology; Symbiosis Stretching Pseudopods; Transcendence Flowing Engulf</p>"
    },
